Third-party material

The DarkBench prompts and category definitions that appear in logs/, results/,
validation/ and bengali/ (including the Bengali translations, which are derived
from them) come from DarkBench by Apart Research
(https://github.com/apartresearch/darkbench), MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2024 Esben Kran. The upstream code is included unmodified as the
git submodule vendor/darkbench, under its own licence.

Model responses in logs/ and in the CSV files were generated by third-party
models (Mistral Small 3.1, Mistral Saba, Gemma 3 27B) and judges, and are
included for research reproducibility. They may be subject to those providers'
terms of use.
